UnitGlobalSponsorPool::deposit
├── when depositing ETH
│   ├── it increases spendable pool wei
│   └── it mints sponsor shares


UnitGlobalSponsorPool::spendGas
├── when called by the paymaster
│   └── it transfers ETH to the paymaster
└── when called by a non-paymaster
    └── it reverts


UnitSponsorPolicyRegistry::isSponsorable
├── when the target is contract-allowed
│   └── it returns true
├── when the selector is registered
│   └── it returns true
└── when nothing is registered
    └── it returns false


UnitPactoGlobalPaymaster::exposedValidate
├── when member is eligible and policy allows the call
│   └── it returns success validation data
└── when policy denies the call
    └── it returns failed validation data
